# superpowers subagent-driven-development scratch workspace (progress
# ledgers, gate-log dumps, task reports) -- campaign scratch, not PR
# content; a prior campaign PR (6a022750) hand-deleted one such file that
# had been force-added in error, believing this was already gitignored --
# it was not. This closes that gap so it cannot recur.
.superpowers/sdd/

# benchmark output artifacts (generated by scripts/benchmark/*.py)
